OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas post dates set for
OL,4,AChannel Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across the Channel Islands have
OL,7,Funtil mid-December to post Christmas
OL,8,Fcards and gifts to the UK.
OL,10,FJersey Post and Guernsey Post have both
OL,11,Fconfirmed the last recommended dates to
OL,12,Fget letters, parcels and documents from
OL,13,Fthe islands in the run-up to the
OL,14,Ffestive period.
OL,16,FIn Jersey, the last recommended date
OL,17,Ffor cards and parcels to the UK and
OL,18,FIsle of Man is 15 December if using the
OL,19,Ftracked and signed service, while
OL,20,Fnon-track and signed post can be sent
OL,21,Fby 11 December.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
