OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas post dates set for
OL,4,AChannel Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of Guernsey have been advised
OL,7,Fto post letters to the UK by 17
OL,8,FDecember - or 18 December if using
OL,9,Fspecial delivery - and parcels to the
OL,10,FUK, Jersey and Isle of Man by 14
OL,11,FDecember.
